  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Matte Finish</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Non-Comedogenic</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Hydrating</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean at Sephora</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Liquid Formula</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>A featherlight liquid bronzer that leaves skin with a wash of sunkissed warmth and a hydrated, shimmer-free, matte finish.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Coverage: </strong>Light</p><p><strong><br>Finish: </strong>Matte</p><p><strong><br>Formulation: </strong>Liquid</p><p><strong><br>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></strong>- Prebiotic Moisturizing Complex: Moisturizes, supports the skin microbiome, and delivers a cooling sensation.</p><p>- Amino-Infused Active Blend: Boosts the skin’s natural tan.</p><p>- Hydra Nourish Blend: Delivers a nourishing, non-tacky finish with a lightweight feel.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Ingredient Callouts:</strong> This product is gluten-free, cruelty-free, and comes in recyclable packaging.</p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Apply with fingers or a brush for a more refined finish. Shake well.<br>-Wear all over for a wash of warmth. For a more targeted bronze, apply anywhere the sun would naturally hit&mdash;over cheeks, temples, and forehead.<br>-Keep adding to build up the bronze. <br>-Can be used on bare skin or over foundation.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">-Prebiotic Moisturizing Complex: Moisturizes, supports the skin microbiome, and delivers a cooling sensation.<br>-Amino-Infused Active Blend: Boosts the skin&rsquo;s natural tan.<br>-Hydra Nourish Blend: Delivers a nourishing, non-tacky finish with a lightweight feel.<br><br>Aqua/Water/Eau, Butylene Glycol, Glycerin, Octyldodecanol, C10-18 Triglycerides, Mica, Pentylene Glycol, Zea Mays (Corn) Starch, Polyglyceryl-4 Caprate, Polyglyceryl-3 Polyricinoleate, Glyceryl Stearate, Xylitol, Capryloyl/Capryloyl Leucine Isosorbide Esters, Isosorbide, Daucus Carota (Carrot) Sativa Seed Oil, Glyceryl Caprylate/Caprate, Helianthus Annuus (Sunflower) Seed Oil, Sodium Stearoyl Lactylate, Polyglyceryl-3 Diisostearate, Xanthan Gum, Tapioca Starch, Algin, Tocopherol, Potassium Sorbate, Tin Oxide, May Contain/ Peut Contenir (+/-): Titanium Dioxide (Ci 77891), Iron Oxides (Ci 77491, Ci 77492, Ci 77499).<br><br><i>The list of ingredients is subject to change. Please consult the packaging of the product purchased.</i></div></details>",
  "description_html": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Matte Finish</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Non-Comedogenic</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Hydrating</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean at Sephora</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Liquid Formula</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>A featherlight liquid bronzer that leaves skin with a wash of sunkissed warmth and a hydrated, shimmer-free, matte finish.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Coverage: </strong>Light</p><p><strong><br>Finish: </strong>Matte</p><p><strong><br>Formulation: </strong>Liquid</p><p><strong><br>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></strong>- Prebiotic Moisturizing Complex: Moisturizes, supports the skin microbiome, and delivers a cooling sensation.</p><p>- Amino-Infused Active Blend: Boosts the skin’s natural tan.</p><p>- Hydra Nourish Blend: Delivers a nourishing, non-tacky finish with a lightweight feel.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Ingredient Callouts:</strong> This product is gluten-free, cruelty-free, and comes in recyclable packaging.</p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Apply with fingers or a brush for a more refined finish. Shake well.<br>-Wear all over for a wash of warmth. For a more targeted bronze, apply anywhere the sun would naturally hit&mdash;over cheeks, temples, and forehead.<br>-Keep adding to build up the bronze. <br>-Can be used on bare skin or over foundation.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">-Prebiotic Moisturizing Complex: Moisturizes, supports the skin microbiome, and delivers a cooling sensation.<br>-Amino-Infused Active Blend: Boosts the skin&rsquo;s natural tan.<br>-Hydra Nourish Blend: Delivers a nourishing, non-tacky finish with a lightweight feel.<br><br>Aqua/Water/Eau, Butylene Glycol, Glycerin, Octyldodecanol, C10-18 Triglycerides, Mica, Pentylene Glycol, Zea Mays (Corn) Starch, Polyglyceryl-4 Caprate, Polyglyceryl-3 Polyricinoleate, Glyceryl Stearate, Xylitol, Capryloyl/Capryloyl Leucine Isosorbide Esters, Isosorbide, Daucus Carota (Carrot) Sativa Seed Oil, Glyceryl Caprylate/Caprate, Helianthus Annuus (Sunflower) Seed Oil, Sodium Stearoyl Lactylate, Polyglyceryl-3 Diisostearate, Xanthan Gum, Tapioca Starch, Algin, Tocopherol, Potassium Sorbate, Tin Oxide, May Contain/ Peut Contenir (+/-): Titanium Dioxide (Ci 77891), Iron Oxides (Ci 77491, Ci 77492, Ci 77499).<br>